{"type":"message","id":"27de423c","parentId":"00d2771a","timestamp":"2026-03-26T20:29:16.408Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"让我分析一下这些时间戳：\n\n当前时间：2026-03-27 04:28 UTC+8 = 1774585680（大约）\n\n从 heartbeat-state.json：\n- lastChecks.email: 1774484880\n- lastChecks.calendar: 1774616480\n- lastChecks.weather: 1774425720\n- lastChecks.mentions: 1774485080\n- lastProactiveReachoutAt: 1774537140\n- openclawProjectReminder: 2026-03-26T13:26:00+08:00\n\n等等，我需要准确计算当前时间戳。2026-03-27 04:28 UTC+8，对应的 UTC 时间是 2026-03-26 20:28。\n\n用 Python 计算一下：\n\n```python\nimport datetime\n# Asia/Shanghai 2026-03-27 04:28:00\n# UTC is 2026-03-26 20:28:00\ndt_utc = datetime.datetime(2026, 3, 26, 20, 28, tzinfo=datetime.timezone.utc)\ntimestamp = dt_utc.timestamp()\n# This should be around 1774585680\n```\n\n让我估算：\n- lastChecks.email: 1774484880 - 约 25 小时前\n- lastChecks.calendar: 1774616480 - 约 -8 小时后（这是未来的时间！）\n- lastChecks.weather: 1774425720 - 约 44 小时前\n- lastChecks.mentions: 1774485080 - 约 25 小时前\n\n\n- lastProactiveReachoutAt: 1774537140 - 约 5 小时前\n- openclawProjectReminder: 2026-03-26 13:26，约 15 小时前\n\n我注意到 lastChecks.calendar 的时间戳实际上是未来的时间，这表明上次日历检查可能在错误的时区被记录。这种异常需要仔细调查。\n\n当前时间是凌晨 4 点，根据 HEARTBEAT.md 的规则，如果没有紧急事项，系统应该直接返回 HEARTBEAT_OK。\n\n但 MEMORY.md 提到用户要求每 30 分钟汇报一次 OpenClaw 贡献项目进展，这可能会影响当前的休眠策略。项目汇报位于飞书群 oc_f68e4447ecaeb604046c3d8ef84681f3，需要特别关注。 I'll check the project details to determine if any action is needed, focusing on the specific project context. I'll examine the memory file to understand the current status and recent progress of the OpenClaw contribution project.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ty59dsjd4q8hjamrz6zuaap7","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/root/.openclaw/workspace/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"arkcode","model":"glm-4.7","usage":{"input":23585,"output":601,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24186,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWri